{{ModBox}}
'''Fatal Acceleration''' is a [[mod]] that increases the [[Projectile Speed]] of non-hitscan [[:Category:Shotgun|Shotguns]], and increases the effective range of shotguns before [[Damage Falloff]] takes effect.

