==Drop Locations==
{{DropLocations}}

==Tips==
*This mod can be used in conjunction with {{M|Fomorian Accelerant}}, effectively doubling the {{Weapon|Drakgoon}}'s projectile speed on top of giving each projectile additional ricochets.

==Trivia==
*Previously, the shotgun featured in the mod's picture was the {{Weapon|Tigris}}, which at the time did not get any benefit from the mod's effects.
**The picture also featured {{WF|Volt}} with his [[Volt Pulse Helmet|Pulse Helmet]], but the dangling ornaments on the back of the helmet were missing.

